<title>USA: Brite Voice moves, reorganizes, sees charge.</title>
<headline>Brite Voice moves, reorganizes, sees charge.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kansas 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brite Voice Systems Inc said on Wednesday it planned to reorganize the company and move its headquarters to Heathrow, Florida, resulting in a one-time charge in either the second or third quarters.</p>
<p>Brite said it expected to narrow its focus, eliminating products and services which were not performing up to expectations or had limited growth prospects.</p>
<p>The company provides enhanced telecommunications systems and services.</p>
</text>
